A '''prayer enhance''' is a potion made and used within the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. Each dose gradually restores the player's [[Prayer points]] for either 275 seconds (4 minutes and 35 seconds) or 290 seconds (4 minutes and 50 seconds). The duration appears to vary between players: those who receive a chatbox warning that the effect is about to expire receive the 290-second duration, while those who do not receive the warning receive the 275-second duration.

The potion can be made at level 65 [[Herblore]] by using a [[buchu leaf]] on a [[water-filled gourd vial]] while carrying a [[cicely]] in the inventory. This produces a four-dose potion and grants 20 Herblore experience.

It is the standard variant of the prayer enhance potions, alongside [[prayer enhance (-)]] and [[prayer enhance (+)]]. Like the other variants, it cannot be taken outside the Chambers of Xeric.

==Effects==
{{Incomplete|Determine the number of restoration activations and the interval between activations at each Prayer level.}}
Each activation restores one [[Prayer points|Prayer point]]. The exact number of activations and the interval between them have not yet been confirmed.


